# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Mixed line endings were a live hazard here, not a style preference: any tool
# that rewrites a file normalizes them silently, so an unrelated one-line edit
# turns into a whole-file diff and buries the real change. That happened once
# already (a 15-line edit to src/types/binaryformats.jl produced a 764-line
# diff) and was only caught by reading the stat before pushing.
#
# `text=auto` lets git detect text vs binary rather than trusting this list;
# `eol=lf` fixes the working-tree ending on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
